==Trivia==
*Rapper Cat is one of the few characters to have a first-person Japanese description.
**Rapper Cat's first-person pronoun is 俺 ''ore'', which is generally casual and masculine.
*The word 猫舌 ''nekojita'' in Rapper Cat's Japanese description literally translates to "cat tongue", but actually refers to a tongue too sensitive to withstand hot food or beverages.

